{"shortDescription":"On 2 September 2026 AB “Novaturas” (the “Company”) received a notification from the Company’s shareholder Mr. Neşet Koçkar about the decision of the Bank of Lithuania to approve the circular of a non-competitive mandatory tender offer to buy up the remaining ordinary registered voting shares of the…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["On 2 September 2026 AB “Novaturas” (the “Company”) received a notification from the Company’s shareholder Mr. Neşet Koçkar about the decision of the Bank of Lithuania to approve the circular of a non-competitive mandatory tender offer to buy up the remaining ordinary registered voting shares of the Company."]},{"type":"p","children":["The tender offer price is EUR 0.877 per 1 (one) ordinary registered share of the Company, EUR 0.03 par value (ISIN LT0000131872) each. Commencement of the implementation of the tender offer is on 7 September 2026, termination – on 21 September 2026."]},{"type":"p","children":["Comprehensive conditions of the tender offer are presented in the circular attached (please see the annex)."]},{"type":"p","children":["Aleksejs Kriščuks"]},{"type":"p","children":["CEO"]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=A-GsA97p2AGNi3sJ4GxWLx3KseH6wRFcWLZWXruxPFQebmkEU4pIuLw7hyHQ-S1BhhicILjYm6WkzuM4dY4O6zr9dPfoyo-f35H62PVAhrJ63ZWZQ19QjkxxA_zxAVTPqkad_Gih6ykZRRV9VUhCyO8SvJw81grmEr5z7STrv8WSJ7mcxH4lid63YSzUiQ-4fckxLfI-sjGcaudwIbMbo16gVWcWAwsuia445_doXnJxVr4HF1hLT2GnE_eCpPf1agS0gNg3ET85ZZP_tkrI3khOoBEc51d9ZnlYxQCjSq2Z7N8q6e6ciKtqiNPdIheab-rYwo2g86UeEGY2_r0HyvY43yrbCFym4rY44DCE3Rd7ihBYj6VpIxECMl8FYxJcSpCIbX-QlCwP3Hcja-R3pBXZXBngI8xFk1SsBlB8qndjc_rOyqf_sXUQ_8F8bq93yHmIAXd1Q3HRXWjUKUUbzneNdkXTRrcHPc8TVKSolsL3dTPMBi7vZ0MlzWHdHs1GkAVdqAZq7Q19DrLSonEW8QWZE3_7_wi8Gt_2CUstL0MuJTFKKt6caUTtmj-FnzZVwUMbXFNm1MD1wIP1CZ2fqBm8WcOOQckzONtby8hEb3CZ33kAGHS_KFHaES1MQ66m89KEiwdCru1yBsVmWAIDyFCIZYhQFlmGYsPRjzo1IL4LO1-rF6sKV6iKQ_fWPIY01f